{
  "dom_id": "step-t2053",
  "name": "Introduction",
  "problem": "Remember that we can place equivalent ratios in a ratio table, like the one below.\n\n| $\\color{blue}x$ | $\\color{red}y$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $\\color{blue}1$ | $\\color{red}2$ |\n| $\\color{blue}2$ | $\\color{red}4$ |\n| $\\color{blue}4$ | $\\color{red}8$ |\n\nBy setting the values in the left column as $\\color{blue}x$-coordinates and the values in the right column as the corresponding $\\color{red}y$-coordinates, we can graph the points to represent a relationship between the ratios.\n\nIn this case, we have the following ordered pairs: $({\\color{blue}1},{\\color{red}2}),$ $({\\color{blue}2},{\\color{red}4}),$ $({\\color{blue}4},{\\color{red}8}).$\n\nPlotting these points on a coordinate plane, we get the following graph:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14152648/assets/0c4abb8d462730ed9b532feeca1e0a800f5376a978bfc799afb9d9a927ff310d.png)\n\nConnecting the points gives us a straight line! Plotting equivalent ratios will *always* give a straight line. Furthermore, the straight line will *always* pass through the origin $(0,0).$",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-t2053\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Introduction</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t2053\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n      