\"890\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1335,0)\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-38\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"1835\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"2225\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Plotting these points on a coordinate plane, we get the following graph:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-d8dee400d56d83eff2607955df4071cf\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/d8dee400d56d83eff2607955df4071cf\"></div>\n\n<p>Connecting the points gives us a straight line! Plotting equivalent ratios will <em>always</em> give a straight line. Furthermore, the straight line will <em>always</em> pass through the origin <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"5.815ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 2503.7 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\">(0,0).</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E14-MJMAIN-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E14-MJMAIN-30\" d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E14-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T13